// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Dr_Boyd 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Dr. Boyd 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2312233579" "Dr. Boyd"
// ProfessionString :
"P2873906088" "Field Researcher"
// DescriptionString :
"P655415085" "Dr. Bruce Boyd is a master of applying differnt disciplines of science to new problems in unusual ways. Already famous in scientific circles for his papers on faster than light travel based off of musical theory, information theory, and genetics; he was one of the first researchers to volunteer for the expedition to the Shadow Shard. He's made several breakthroughs in understanding the strange nature of this alien place."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2795972436" "I don't talk to villains, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P2819676258" "So much to do out here, {HeroName}. So much to do."
// HelloString :
"P906183720" "Remind me to tell you more of what we've learned once you've taken care of, well, everything."
// HelloString :
"P544821510" "Ah! {HeroName}! I was just thinking through some calculations. Hope you weren't waiting long."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3367086147" "I'm sorry, but I'm very busy with my work right now. Perhaps you should speak with {LastContactName} instead?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3989882071" "{HeroName}! I've heard a great deal about you, and hope that we'll be able to do some great work together. There's so many things to learn out here, I tell you I could spend my whole life in this place. Well, if it weren't for the contsant attacks by ravenous monsters, at least."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P986730333" "I don't have anything more for you, perhaps your other contacts have something?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P570402265" "You need to finish some of the things you already have on your plate, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1317581692" "I have something, but it's classified beyond your current Security Level."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P471027664" "I don't know what we would have done without all of your assistance, {HeroName}. If any of the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>enhancements</a> I have available to me can help you, let me know. I've had General Hammond prepare a special set of frequencies and codes so that you can contact me whenever you need to."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3065995456" "Your ability to come through always amazes me. {HeroName}, you are the reason that my research has gotten this far. Please take a look at the additional <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> available to me."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2079163781" "I'm sorry, {HeroName}, but my research is moving into more theoretical areas. Your mighty efforts would be best used elsewhere."
// LocationString :
"P168164031" "Point Echo, FireBase Zulu"
// IntroString :
"P3217261666" "Dr. Bruce Boyd is a bit out there, but he posses one of the finest minds for correlating information. He's made a career out of finding connections between things that seem unrelated, and forging new theories across scientific disciplines. He's been invaluable out here for everything from figuring out how the gravity geysers work to analyzing the native's diets. He's asked for hero assistance to continue his work, and mentioned you specifically."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1278416131" "Choose Dr. Boyd"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1458545475" "Dr. Boyd's been working on a lot of things out here, and I doubt there'll be any shortage of missions he needs done."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1614138298" "One of my colleagues has been quite interested in getting your assistance."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3805662860" "Several of my colleagues have been quite interested in getting your assistance."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


