// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Dr_Huxley 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Dr. Huxley 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2246272756" "Dr. Huxley"
// ProfessionString :
"P946091507" "Field Biologist"
// DescriptionString :
"P4204601509" "Dr. Ada Huxley has spent most of her career studying at the frontiers of biology in the quiet of her California lab. She requested assignement to the Expeditionary force after seeing the first samples of Kora Fruit brought back to Earth, and has been studying the life-sustaining fruit fervently ever since her arrival."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P1007614599" "Oh, it's you, {HeroName}. I was wondering if you might have time to help me?"
// HelloString :
"P300404281" "I was hoping you'd show up today, {HeroName}"
// HelloString :
"P3834377894" "Howdy, {HeroName}! I'm on the verge of a breakthrough, but I could use a little help."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1176514572" "Wow, you're {HeroName}! {HeroName}, talking to me! I'm, I'm so flattered. But I won't keep you. I'm sure you have so many things to do with {LastContactName} or whoever. <br><br>I can't beleive that was {HeroName}! I should have asked for an autograph."
// FirstVisitString :
"P535250891" "Oh. Oh, my. You, you're {HeroName}! You're really {HeroName}, aren't you! I mean, I asked for some assistance, but I never thought they'd send someone as famous as, well, as you. I, um, well, um. It's my absolute pleasure to work with you. I don't know if I'll have any missions to save the world or anything, but, well, I'll do everything to help. Er, help me. I mean, to help you to help me. I mean, oh, you know."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1216353773" "Oh, Thank you for asking {HeroName}, but I've got all the samples I need. Perhaps your other contacts have something?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3553327636" "I'm sure I could use your help, {HeroName}, but I know you're busy. Maybe later, after you've finished your other missions and saved the world once or twice."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1387793421" "Well, I have some things that maybe you could help with, but not right now. They're rather dangerous, and I'd hate for you to get hurt of some little thing for me. Maybe when you've gone up a few security levels."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P453177798" "You've been such a great help, {HeroName}. I can't beleive I was ever nervous around you. Let me help you out with some of the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> I have. I hope you'll contact me frequently."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3717829652" "You've done so much to help me, {HeroName}, that I'll have to give you a credit on my next research paper. Here, please see if I have any <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> that could help you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P14842049" "I want to thank you for working with me, {HeroName}, but there are so many things out there I know you need to attend to. It would be selfish of me to take up more of your time. Let me just say thank you for taking the time to talk to me."
// LocationString :
"P3995230159" "The Cascades, Mole Point Charlie"
// IntroString :
"P3044728047" "Dr. Ada Huxley is studying the Kora Fruit, one of the staples of the native's diet. Different Kora Fruit can have a number of different effects, all of them beneficial. Her work could be very important to medical research in a number of ways, but she's having trouble getting fresh samples of Kora Fruit to study."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2810744342" "Choose Dr. Huxley"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1096258705" "Dr. Huxley is a smart woman who's so abosrbed in her work she occasionally forgets where she is or how important her work could be. Another benefit of working with her is getting access to Kora Fruit."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1833687500" "One of my co-workers have asked to be introduced to you. Is that alright?"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3991344812" "Some of my co-workers have asked to be introduced to you. Is that alright?"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


