// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Dr_Quaterfield 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Dr. Quaterfield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P85839316" "Dr. Quaterfield"
// ProfessionString :
"P2657385413" "Head Scientist"
// DescriptionString :
"P1111850906" "A brilliant researcher who often works at the far extremes of science, Dr. Thomas Quaterfield was selected by the United Nations to lead the science team studying the bizarre dimension called the 'Shadow Shard'. Quaterfield's researchers have already made several startling discoveries, many of which have been classified as potential matters of global security."
// WrongAllianceString :
// TaskForceInvite :
"P1162185513" "I'm Dr. Thomas Quaterfield. I'm in charge of all of the research being done here at Firebase Zulu, and throughout what we've dubbed the 'Shadow Shard'. Right now, I've got a major problem that's going to need people with your kind of talents to solve."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P2312578244" "I'm sorry, but I'm very busy at the moment. I have research in jeopardy and people missing. You may be able to help me, but you'll need to be a higher security level. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 members on your team, all of them at least Level 40. If they are over Level 44, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 44 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P1564328346" "It's very good of you to off to help me, but at your level of power there are other things that you can do. Perhaps you should speak with Sara Moore in the Cascade Archipelago at Mole Point Charlie, or Justin Augustine near Chantry Hortha vine? <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 members on your team, all of them at least Level 40. If they are over Level 44, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 44 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P1381916799" "To form a task force, you need eight heroes in your group. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 members on your team, all of them at least Level 40. If they are over Level 44, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 44 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P656601308" "I need to talk to your team leader."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P3314444780" "I need everyone in your team present and accounted for."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1479637085" "Some members of your team don't meet the requirements for this assignment. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 members on your team, all of them at least Level 40. If they are over Level 44, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 44 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P1899793819" "Task Force Seaborg"
// TaskForceName :
"P179941832" "Task Force Feynman"
// TaskForceName :
"P1585960261" "Task Force Dyson"
// TaskForceName :
"P2022607268" "Task Force Bernouli"
// TaskForceName :
"P2679486001" "Task Force Heisenberg"
// HelloString :
"P4205791683" "Good to see you."
// HelloString :
"P1122254292" "There's still so much we don't know."
// HelloString :
"P4009422482" "Let me fill you in with what I know."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2537356280" "Idon'tKnowYouString"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3828306380" "General Hammond asked that I assign your task force a code-name. I think {TaskForceName} sounds about right."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3563489449" "Well, that seems to wrap things up."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1842720258" "You've all really been a great help out here, {TaskForceName}. With your continued effort, we may yet unravel this mystery. General Hammond has authorized me to give you a direct link to me, should you need to speak with me about anything."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3815281867" "I cannot overstate how great a help you've been to the entire science team here at Firebase Zulu."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1336615585" "Our research here has revealed greater threats than the problems I have for you."
// LocationString :
"P2754547058" "Firebase Zulu"
// IntroString :
"P2635546398" "Dr. Thomas Quaterfield is the head of the science team performing research in the Shadow Shard. He's facing several problems that could use assistance from a hero of your stature."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3965614729" "Choose Dr. Quaterfield"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3684933697" "Quaterfield is a top man, absolutely brilliant and not unused to working in dangerous areas. I'm certain he'll have plenty for you to do."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2123373539" "One of the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>scientists</a> working with me could use your assistance."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2333150682" "Several of the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>scientists</a> working with me have requested your assistance."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


