// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Faathim The Kind 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3898478477" "Faathim The Kind"
// ProfessionString :
"P3339224921" "Master of the Chantry"
// DescriptionString :
"P1165662000" "This mysterious entity is the master of the Chantry, the floating spherical castle under constant assault by the forces of the Rularuu. In the few whispered tales of Faathim the natives repeat, they speak of his compassion and call him Faathim the Kind. However, his origins and his purpose are unknown."
// WrongAllianceString :
// TaskForceInvite :
"P1304068539" "I am Faathim, called Faathim the Kind. You are beings of great power, both potent in might and dedicated to protection of the defenseless. I have watched your battles, and I have watched your triumphs, and I have come to think that you may be the ones who can stop a great destruction. The Madness that broke the world is gaining power beyond imagining, and may soon break the world once more. Or worse."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P1465637992" "Your will is strong, but you lack the power for this work. Return when you are ready. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 members on your team, all of them at least Level 44 in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P329772011" "This text should not appear"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P2105738192" "You will need eight heroes in your group to make a Task Force. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 members on your team, all of them at least Level 44 in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P3460352081" "Send to me the leader of your team."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P2289900608" "Your team must be present before me in their entirety."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P531581524" "Some members of your team have the will for this battle, but not yet the strength. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 members on your team, all of them at least Level 44 in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P791265803" "Task Force Naruum"
// TaskForceName :
"P2192315880" "Task Force Lamune"
// TaskForceName :
"P3003487439" "Task Force Sharydia"
// TaskForceName :
"P526407634" "Task Force Xanova"
// TaskForceName :
"P3620859216" "Task Force Veyro"
// TaskForceName :
"P1267963583" "Task Force Riktasi"
// HelloString :
"P1238653523" "I greet you, {TaskForceName}. How fares this battle?"
// HelloString :
"P2606164708" "Know, {TaskForceName}, that the future of many rides upon your shoulders"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1657278088" "Idontknowyoustring"
// FirstVisitString :
"P1372549634" "For this great task, I will give unto you a great name. {TaskForceName} you shall be called. Do this name honor, for it is all that remains of civilization long passed into memory."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1834177136" "Lanaru will reform his body, and the threat shall come again. Until Rularuu is destroyed, we are immortal. I await that distant day."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3676776142" "You have now come to see the true magnitude of the task before you. Will you persevere? This, I do not know."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P184951047" "This great undertaking nears it's conclusion. Will you see it through, or is all of your strenght spent? We shall yet see."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P39839055" "You do a great honor to ask for my help, but your great power is best used elsewhere."
// LocationString :
"P1408324586" "Within the Chantry"
// IntroString :
"P2703563184" "IntroString"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P800483350" "IntroAccept"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2900635268" "IntroSendoff"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P369718375" "IntroOne"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2013910156" "IntroTwo"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


