// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : General_Hammond 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : General Hammond 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4285651742" "General Hammond"
// ProfessionString :
"P2360394465" "Brigadier General"
// DescriptionString :
"P3412873937" "Brigadier General Marlon Hammond is the man in charge of the allied expeditionary force exploring the dimension dubbed 'The Shadow Shard'. From his early years in the SAS when he battled subterranian reptile men to his coordination of British defenses against an invasion of alien mutant cyborgs, General Hammond has displayed an uncanny ability to handle the strange and unknown on numerous occasions. This made him a natural choice to command this expedition."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P3811469564" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There's a lot of work to do yet before we're secure here.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1244581677" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We may require your services, {HeroName}.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1402075406" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've been developing a pretty solid plan of action.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P739922350" "As I'm supposed to be a contact for everyone, you likely shouldn't be seeing this."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2121834059" "Welcome to Firebase Zulu, {HeroName}. I am Brigadier General Marlon Hammond. I've been placed in charge of security matters here at Zulu and throughout this place. I've been informed that you've shown some interest in helping us out, and to be frank, we can use any assistance we can get."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P710127400" "Zulu is secure for the moment, {HeroName}. Your talents and abilities may be of greater use to others right now."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2614862935" "It sounds like you're quite busy at the moment, {HeroName}. I may have some more work for you when you're done."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3972478417" "I don't have any tasks for you at this time. Perhaps when you've reached a higher security clearance."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4028265215" "You've already done some excellent work, {HeroName}. Please see if I have any <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> that can assist you. Also, let me give you the proper frequency and codes to contact me directly."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1410058459" "I've worked with many heroes before, {HeroName}, and I must say that you've earned my respect and trust. If you need enhancements, or would like back-up from my men, please <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>request it</a> of me."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3464448532" "There are other areas of this place that require your assistance."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1644016919" "Explorers from the Portal corporation recently broke through to a strange nearby dimension called the Shadow Shard, and from what I've heard, it could be the source of a major threat. At Portal Corp's request, the UN has placed an international defense force under Brigadier General Marlon Hammond in charge of security operations in this strange dimension, and he's put out a call for hero assistance. General Hammond also has access to a wide variety of enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2534751537" "Choose General Hammond"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2569894753" "General Hammond has a unique ability to think clearly and stay level headed in the face of the unknown. That should be a great asset in the Shadow Shard."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1141256107" "One of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>subordinates</a> could use your assistance."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1361213229" "Several of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>subordinates</a> are requesting your assistance."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


