// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Justin_Augustine 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Justin Augustine 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4106412915" "Justin Augustine"
// ProfessionString :
"P1157260894" "Supernatural Investigator"
// DescriptionString :
"P2164602621" "Justin Augustine is a renowned modern mystic and explorer into the supernatural. He's assisted heroes and governments all over the world in supernatural matters over the course of the last decade, and volunteered to join the Shadow Shard Expeditionary force early on. He is also a wizard of no small power. Most of his power centers on ritual magic, and his own unerring ability to find the right place to be at the perfect time."
// WrongAllianceString :
// TaskForceInvite :
"P2909650759" "You can call me Justin Augustine. I'm a, well, a mystic of sorts. Working with the UN expedition. General Hammond's asked me to investigate some of the stranger things out here, and I think I may have found about the strangest. Floating out in the center of this area may be the key to understanding this whole place, but if I'm gonna figure it out, I'm gonna need help."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P3888149022" "Look, it's nothing personal, but this is some dangerous business. You'll need to be powerful enough to make it through, and you aren't there yet. Come back when you're ready. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 members on your team, all of them at least Level 44 in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P1644734673" "You need eight heroes in your group to make a Task Force. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 members on your team, all of them at least Level 44 in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P2203882284" "Send your team leader to me."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P2396132541" "Bring your whole team here."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1813594090" "I appreciate that you all want to help, but some members of your team aren't powerful enough. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 members on your team, all of them at least Level 44 in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P4156445860" "Task Force Trismegistus"
// TaskForceName :
"P2521860930" "Task Force Merlin"
// TaskForceName :
"P4217175443" "Task Force Dee"
// TaskForceName :
"P516243073" "Task Force Ptah"
// TaskForceName :
"P1547135708" "Task Force Thoth"
// HelloString :
"P37416925" "There's a lot to find out, and I don't know if we have much time"
// HelloString :
"P3043650492" "The key to undestanding this whole place is here."
// HelloString :
"P1878850808" "Time to unravel some legends."
// IDontKnowYouString :
// FirstVisitString :
"P4168108391" "General Hammond asked that I give you lot a code-name while you're working with me on this. He wants it to help keep track, but there's a whole other reason. Naming a thing, like a fellowship of heroes, is a powerful kind of magic. There's a lot aligned against us, so If we're to succeed here, we'll need every advantage we can get. I'm going to give your group the title {TaskForceName}, and let's hope that the powers that be are smiling on us."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1527460150" "Part of me can't beleive it's over. It all makes sense now, I guess. Really, I think I want to take a vacation after all's said and done."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2631161078" "You're a tenacious lot, you are. When I gave you the name {TaskForceName}, I was hoping it would help deflect bad fortune. If we've got this far, it must have worked some. Lieutenant Colonel Flynn has given me a radio to keep in touch with you. Please use it."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2576590950" "You have been so much help, but there is much left to do and time is going fast."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// LocationString :
"P1348340556" "The Chantry, Path of Tears"
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


