// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Lt_Col_Flynn 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Lt. Col. Flynn 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4060885526" "Lt. Col. Flynn"
// ProfessionString :
"P2203662362" "Expedition Explorer"
// DescriptionString :
"P54056492" "Lieutenant Colonel Richard Flynn has spent the last decade as a military consultant for Portal Corporation, assisting them with security, defense, and first contact situations. He'd travelled to dozens of alternate Earths even before he volunteered for the Shadow Shard Expeditionary force. With his experience in alternate realities, he's been assinged to help coordinate the exploration of the Shadow Shard."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P2119853245" "{HeroName}! Hope you don't mind if I make your day even busier?"
// HelloString :
"P3094196359" "I have, oh, about a hundred dire threats that could use your help, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P253351288" "Howdy, {HeroName}, good to see you. I have about a good dozen crises brewing for you."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1915140590" "I got a whole lot that needs doing, and over half of it is paperwork. Why don't you check with {LastContactName} for something to do?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P2124114415" "Well, {HeroName}, here's to hoping you and I can get some things done around here."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P118332326" "This is the first time things have been quiet in a while. Enjoy it. Or you could check out what someone else might have for you to do."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P247921792" "Hold on a second there, {HeroName}. You already have too much to do. Come back when you only have one or two crises to handle. I can wait."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2816020467" "All that I have right now is classified beyond your current Security Level."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P993347783" "I like you, {HeroName}. You do good work, and I appreciate that. Tell you what: I managed to get some extra <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> from supply. Maybe you could use them? I've also rigged up some com channels and codes for you so you can contact me any time."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2636174769" "You've really impressed me, {HeroName}. You just keep on fighting. I've got some more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> from a friend of mine in supply. Let me know what you can use."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P133595978" "I'm a guy who knows what a crisis looks like, {HeroName}, and what it will take to handle it. I think you've gotten powerful enough that all the crises I got aren't worth your time. Don't worry, though. There's a lot of new kids who want a shot, too."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P745374783" "Lt. Colonel Richard Flynn is one of the few seasoned interdimensional explorers in the Expeditionary Force. He's been a liason with the Portal Corporation for years, and has been present at many first contact situations. He's currently coordinating all exploration past Firebase Zulu, and has set up a base in a location called the 'Cascades'."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3038139719" "Choose Lt. Colonel Flynn"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P793379271" "If I know Flynn, he's sure to have found more than enough trouble for you to handle."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3549779779" "By the way, I think I know someone who could use your help."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2408400878" "If you have time, I know some people who could use your help."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


