// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Lt. Volkov 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1187418132" "Lt. Volkov"
// ProfessionString :
"P272172900" "Expedition Commando"
// DescriptionString :
"P921576886" "Though much of Lieutenant Quinn Volkov's military history remains classified for national security reasons, what little is known is quite impressive with over a dozen commendations for valor above and beyond the call of duty. It's also known that Lt. Volkov has often worked against superhuman and supernatural threats to world peace, and that he has worked with Brigadier General Hammond on several occasions. When General Hammond requested him for the UN Expeditionary Force, it's rumored that he threatened to resign if he wasn't allowed to take the assignment. Whether this is due to his belief in the potential threat of the Shadow Shard or his friendship with General Hammond is also unknown."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P1700642397" "Are you ready for the next operation?"
// HelloString :
"P3351818773" "I've got another developing situation."
// HelloString :
"P1461451482" "I've uncovered another building crisis."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3085008894" "Sorry, {HeroName}. I respect your work, but I'm not authorized to talk to you at this time. Maybe you should talk to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4134078451" "Quinn Volkov, Lieutenant, United States Air Force, currently attached to the United Nations Shadow Shard Expeditionary Force. <br><br>I've heard a lot of good things about you, {HeroName}. If you want to help out here and survive, I hope everything I've heard is true."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1486592779" "I'm out of intel. Things are quiet from my end. Maybe you should check with your other sources."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P699977114" "Hold on, {HeroName}. I think you have enough to do already. Come back when you can put your full attention on the work I have for you."
// ComeBackLaterString :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P740461308" "You've made a pretty good start, {HeroName}. I've just been resupplied, so I may have some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> that can help you out. I've linked you in with my communication codes, you should be able to get a hold of me any time. "
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P327964298" "You've done some impressive work, {HeroName}. I think I can trust you to come through when the odds are bad. If there are any <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> I can get for you, well, I know the right people in supply to lean on."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2610976285" "I can handle it from here, {HeroName}. Thanks for the help."
// LocationString :
"P3284571142" "Point November, Fire Base Zulu"
// IntroString :
"P3140044671" "Lt. Quinn Volkov is a decorated military operative, trained specifically in dealing with superhuman and supernatural threats. He's been assigned to provide reconnaissance and intelligence about threats to Fire Base Zulu and the expeditionary force, and approaches the task with some zeal. He's already gathered a good deal of information about what the various villain groups active in the Shard are up to, and how to stop them."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P121719192" "Choose Lt. Volkov"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P808824734" "Lt. Volkov is a highly trained operative. I have no doubt you'll find him very capable, and I hope you'll be able to work well together."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1488584242" "I know someone who could use your assistance."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2014302496" "I've learned about some people who could use your assistance."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


